  "description": "ToolUp SDK meta-manifest — coordinated-bump escape hatch. A consumer Directory.Packages.props imports the package's build/ToolUp.Sdk.props and sets a single ToolUpSdkVersion property; every core package then resolves at that version, and every companion family at the version it shipped beside it. A family's own property (ToolUpAuditSinksVersion, …) moves that family alone. See the package's build/ToolUp.Sdk.props for the full set.",
